  message: "Worked on branch jgstern-agent/fix/ratid (local, based on jgstern-agent/fix/kutal 6fc02d8d7f): 2ad81bff5a, d65dbb9d74, 85f3dfbbc4, ff18f6ceee. Report: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_10032026/ratid.md.\n\nPremise held, plus a second instance the description did not name: py.py's own _resolve_base_class bound a BARE imported external base (from unittest import TestCase; class Plain(TestCase)) to the single in-repo TestCase, since imports only broke ties between 2+ candidates; the aliased form did the same through the original-name re-resolution.\n\nFix: py.py resolves a base expression's ROOT through the file's import bindings first (_import_qualified_base); an out-of-tree target is external (python:<module>:0-0:<Name> + ExternalRef), in-tree / unbound / same-file-shadowed roots keep the old resolution. The in-tree test (_import_target_in_tree) has four arms, each forced by a django A/B failure of an intermediate commit (phantom for OrderSerializer.Meta; html.parser vs django.utils.html; admin_scripts.tests vs tests.admin_scripts.tests). The core linker skips a base an analyzer classified external with an ExternalRef (analyzer_external_bases).\n\nAcceptance A/B (b7417402dc vs kutal+ratid ff18f6ceee, frozen copies, own caches; arm A reproduces kutal's base arm record-for-record): of kutal's 2098 lost django sites, 1673 resolve again at the same site, 425 have the same (caller, target) pair resolved on another line (WI-sodor); all callers linearize. 5338 more django sites gain an inherited resolution; 0 new losses beyond kutal's diff. 123 django and 46 pretix wrong in-tree base binds became module-qualified externals (e.g. pretix TeamCreateView -> django.views.generic.CreateView, was pretix's own CreateView). pretix call sites identical to the kutal arm.\n\nTests: test_py_imported_external_base.py (8 red / 4 control green on first board run; later tests red by live repro on the commit each fixes), test_inheritance_linker.py TestAnalyzerClassifiedExternalBase (5; mutation of the skip re-creates the cycle live). Board smart-test affected selection at ff18f6ceee: 6377 passed, 2 xfailed, 0 failed; changed sources at 100%; mypy ratchet clean.\n\nFiled: WI-pituk (C3 whole-subtree silent refusal), WI-pivap (non-Python siblings, P2), WI-jipij (Kotlin/Swift first segment, PHP drop), WI-vipir (Python in-tree dotted bases still last-segment with sorted fallback)."  # 2ecb
